 "transcript": [
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Why do you not come in to your father and eat a little food?\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"We have been to the officer's house, father, and the house is very fine and the food is very fine and I have a new wife and my brother is very proud and he sets up a great grain market.\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung enters the great room and sits on a chair.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"I have been to the officer's house and have a new wife and my brother is very proud and he sets up a great grain market.\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] Wang Lung looks at his sons.",
  "[action] The eldest son watches his father closely.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"I am old and I have nothing left but my land. I have no gold and I have no silver and I have no food except what I eat from my own land.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung smokes and observes his children.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son watches his father closely.",
  "[action] The youngest son sets down the basket of food.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The youngest son bows humbly to his father.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"It is my wish to give you a little silver and my gold from the shop.\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung refuses his sons' offers.",
  "[action] Wang Lung smokes",
  "[says] Wang Lung refuses his sons' silver.",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The younger son looks at the land and smiles.",
  "[action] The younger son laughs and shakes his head."
